From: gpt-6.1-sol <noreply@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Reuse validated warm video canvases and preserve sampled-frame compatibility

The parent request retains video callbacks through warm completion. Avoid HTTP-thread
redecoding and a second full canvas set. Match ordered media and processor policy.
Like the Python loader, require sampled frames rather than an unselected declared tail.
Late media classification now covers only the reachable preparation deadline error.

